rts2-viewer (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial rts2-viewer package: the Qt5 camera-viewer client (image
    display with logfit stretch, draggable measure cursor with live
    centroid/FWHM fitting, windowing control, and a focus-progress
    graph). Standalone network client - no dependency on rts2-base being
    installed on the same machine, since it only ever talks to a
    centrald over the wire protocol (local or remote).

 -- RTS2 Project <petr@rts2.org>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 19:15:00 +0200
